            },\r\n            \"node_decision\":\"no\",\r\n            \"weight_ranking\":1,\r\n            \"deciders\":[\r\n                {\r\n                    \"decider\":\"filter\",\r\n                    \"decision\":\"NO\",\r\n                    \"explanation\":\"node matches cluster setting [cluster.routing.allocation.exclude] filters [_tier:\"data_cold\"]\"\r\n                }\r\n            ]\r\n        }\r\n    ]\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Steps to reproduce**:\r\n\r\n1. setup a cluster with only one node:\r\n\r\n```\r\nnode.roles: [ data_hot, master ]\r\n```\r\n2. PUT _cluster/settings\r\n\r\n```\r\n{\r\n  \"transient\": {\r\n    \"cluster.routing.allocation.exclude._tier\": \"data_cold\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n3. Create a new index with setting `index.routing.allocation.include._tier_preference:\"data_hot\"`\r\n4. GET _cluster/allocation/explain","closed_by":{"login":"dakrone","id":19060,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MDYw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19060?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dakrone","html_url":"https://github.com/dakrone","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dakrone/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dakrone/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dakrone/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dakrone/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dakrone/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dakrone/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dakrone/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dakrone/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dakrone/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/66679/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_u